          <h4><b>50 Easy Isometric Mazes, 5 Levels, 3D Maze Activity Book for Kids</b></h4> 
          <p><b>Price: </b> $9.99 </p>
          <p><b>Stock left: </b> 99 </p>    
          <p> Set sail for a brand-new adventure! 3D Mazes for Kids – Vol. 2 invites young explorers (ages 4–8) to discover even more island fun—packed with beginner-friendly challenges, creativity, and imagination.

50 Easy 3D Island Mazes – Engaging isometric-style mazes that are simple to follow and fun to solve.

5 Gamified Levels – Kids “level up” as they complete mazes across new islands with different themes and environments.

 Draw, Doodle & Explore – Each maze is a creative playground! Kids can add paths, decorate islands, or invent stories.
 Made for Young Minds – Builds early logic skills, confidence, and creativity—perfect for preschool and early elementary ages.
 Great for Travel, Quiet Time, or Classrooms – Lightweight, screen-free fun wherever your little one goes.

This volume continues the imaginative journey from Vol. 1 with all-new mazes and more space to be creative. A perfect companion for curious kids who love to explore, draw, and play.

Created by Maze Mode Studio – Where every page is a new adventure!             
 </p>

